(6494281, 965477, 108069, '<td valign="top">The challenge notes clearly said "colorful little" blocks. Not only is that not a little block, it''s NOT IN COLOR! DNMC!!!<br/> <br/>Ha! Amazingly clever and such a creative spin on the challenge. Truly stands out among the pack. It''s in my top two, and would be an absolute favorite if I  were certain that background were real. Though I''ll give you a 10 as though it is.<br/> <br/>One complaint... Needs more booze.</td>', 'The challenge notes clearly said "colorful little" blocks. Not only is that not a little block, it''s NOT IN COLOR! DNMC!!! Ha! Amazingly clever and such a creative spin on the challenge. Truly stands out among the pack. It''s in my top two, and would be an absolute favorite if I  were certain that background were real. Though I''ll give you a 10 as though it is. One complaint... Needs more booze.', '2011-08-05 12:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
