(6494496, 965502, 125275, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of perspective, and I love the never-ending staircase! I wonder if dodge and burn could help with the shadows on the left side? Either way, this is one of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'Awesome use of perspective, and I love the never-ending staircase! I wonder if dodge and burn could help with the shadows on the left side? Either way, this is one of my favorites in the challenge.', '2011-08-05 17:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
