(6502874, 964453, 132251, '<td valign="top">Woo Hoo! my most comments ever... 15?! that is nuts, I guess you have to pull a stunt like this to get some comments. Now if I can only get some constructive comments on my others, I may start learning what you guys like to see here...</td>', 'Woo Hoo! my most comments ever... 15?! that is nuts, I guess you have to pull a stunt like this to get some comments. Now if I can only get some constructive comments on my others, I may start learning what you guys like to see here...', '2011-08-12 16:14:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6502877, 965395, 3746, '<td valign="top">Brilliant!</td>', 'Brilliant!', '2011-08-12 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6502880, 964448, 58634, '<td valign="top">Your images are always brilliant and abstract, and always stand out in the crowd. This is no exception.</td>', 'Your images are always brilliant and abstract, and always stand out in the crowd. This is no exception.', '2011-08-12 16:49:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6503027, 965477, 39057, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. I read your comments about the photo background. I figured it was a photo back there but couldn''t be sure....so I voted as if you really went up to a high-rise and set something up by a window.<br/> <br/>I recently got a DQ for this image.<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=954483" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1398/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_954483.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1398/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_954483.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1398/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_954483.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>This was an EXPERT editing challenge. I was DQ''d because I used a photo that I did not produce myself - on the face of my model. I got permission from the photographer first.<br/> <br/>The DQ reason simply states: <b>All photos used must have been taken by you.</b> If this DQ reason was spread around fairly, then the Pea Pods may be #1.<br/> <br/>Oh well, I''ve been in forum disputes before and all it does is get people ranting and raving !  I''ll take my medicine and take the DQ and dream over your ribbon !! <br/> <br/> I just wish there was a way to be fair to all.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-12 19:42:10.</i></td>', 'Nice photo. I read your comments about the photo background. I figured it was a photo back there but couldn''t be sure....so I voted as if you really went up to a high-rise and set something up by a window. I recently got a DQ for this image.  This was an EXPERT editing challenge. I was DQ''d because I used a photo that I did not produce myself - on the face of my model. I got permission from the photographer first. The DQ reason simply states: All photos used must have been taken by you. If this DQ reason was spread around fairly, then the Pea Pods may be #1. Oh well, I''ve been in forum disputes before and all it does is get people ranting and raving !  I''ll take my medicine and take the DQ and dream over your ribbon !!   I just wish there was a way to be fair to all.', '2011-08-12 20:40:56.000000', '2011-08-12 20:42:10.000000', 0),
(6503036, 965377, 50641, '<td valign="top">It may have been a display but you made some great choices - congrats!</td>', 'It may have been a display but you made some great choices - congrats!', '2011-08-12 21:04:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(6503055, 965377, 76335, '<td valign="top">A new PB. Good for you! I love the vision that went into this.</td>', 'A new PB. Good for you! I love the vision that went into this.', '2011-08-12 21:34:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6503056, 964448, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the crunchy shapes that tumble out of this.</td>', 'I love the crunchy shapes that tumble out of this.', '2011-08-12 21:36:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6503058, 965477, 130849, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first blue!<br/>Nicely done and the original Ebbets photo is one of my favorites!</td>', 'Congrats on your first blue!Nicely done and the original Ebbets photo is one of my favorites!', '2011-08-12 21:39:46.000000', NULL, 0);
