(6503189, 965477, 109387, '<td valign="top">Hi Ken, I had seen your case. I don''t know if I''ll get a DQ for this shot but your situation was pretty different: you got the DQ for not using the image as a texture. I simply used it as a blurred background. It was not the main subject of the photo I shot. But soon we''ll have news from SC.</td>', 'Hi Ken, I had seen your case. I don''t know if I''ll get a DQ for this shot but your situation was pretty different: you got the DQ for not using the image as a texture. I simply used it as a blurred background. It was not the main subject of the photo I shot. But soon we''ll have news from SC.', '2011-08-13 02:14:35.000000', NULL, 0),
