(6503600, 965477, 39057, '<td valign="top">I''m just confused by the term "all photos must have been taken by you"<br/> <br/>I have a feeling your ribbon will stand. Good luck though!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Alexkc:</b></div><hr/><i> Hi Ken, I had seen your case. I don''t know if I''ll get a DQ for this shot but your situation was pretty different: you got the DQ for not using the image as a texture. I simply used it as a blurred background. It was not the main subject of the photo I shot. But soon we''ll have news from SC. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I''m just confused by the term "all photos must have been taken by you" I have a feeling your ribbon will stand. Good luck though! Originally posted by Alexkc: Hi Ken, I had seen your case. I don''t know if I''ll get a DQ for this shot but your situation was pretty different: you got the DQ for not using the image as a texture. I simply used it as a blurred background. It was not the main subject of the photo I shot. But soon we''ll have news from SC. ', '2011-08-13 19:23:51.000000', NULL, 0),
