(6636658, 965477, 49018, '<td valign="top">Did this one get a DQ?<br/>I realize that I probably understand the letter of the rules, but I am totally mistaken about the reasons behind them.<br/>This a creative use of existing imagery and it tries in no way to fool the viewer into anything.<br/>What about photographing passers-by in front of street art, street advertising and so on? Why should this image seen differently rules-wise?<br/>A clever, well developed concept.<br/></td>', 'Did this one get a DQ?I realize that I probably understand the letter of the rules, but I am totally mistaken about the reasons behind them.This a creative use of existing imagery and it tries in no way to fool the viewer into anything.What about photographing passers-by in front of street art, street advertising and so on? Why should this image seen differently rules-wise?A clever, well developed concept.', '2012-01-06 09:51:17.000000', NULL, 0),
